---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: onlyLegionOrProject
    q_auth --> q_check_paused: whenNotPaused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_canceled: whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_not_ended: whenSaleNotEnded
    q_check_not_ended --> q_set_ended: hasEnded = true
    q_set_ended --> q_set_end_time: endTime = block.timestamp
    q_set_end_time --> q_set_refund_end: refundEndTime = block.timestamp + refundPeriodSeconds
    q_set_refund_end --> [*]: emit SaleEnded()

    note right of q_set_ended
        INV-001: sale can only be ended once (hasEnded flag)
        INV-002: refundEndTime = endTime + refundPeriodSeconds
        INV-003: either Legion or project admin can end the sale
    end note
